 refreshing because I've used some  other software from a different brand  from my doorbell camera and let me tell  you it was and is painful at times and  now with that said one of the most  important things to a security camera  system is the app including how well it  works so before I get into the quality  of the cameras let's show off the ufe  security app first and foremost of  course we have the home page right here  showing two of our cameras and the  yuffie home base right here we have the  events tab which shows different events  that happened throughout the day like  for example when I was setting it up it  actually shows the modes I was switching  and that it was seeing a human it  literally says human right here which  was me setting it up and on top of that  you can detect everything from humans  Vehicles pets basically everything using  the bionic mind AI you can also go into  the home base then face management and  you can even add familiar faces to your  own app so it's going to recognize you  and not set off the alarm for example  just go into the albums then choose a  face which detected me right here add in  my own name say it's a family member  which is me and Bam there you go the  familiar faces and added let's actually  add in just one more where is my wife  over here there she is boom that's my  wife add her in just like that now they  also have the security tab right here  which you can switch between the  different modes and each one has a bunch  of customizations like the different  delays for the alarm or leaving and you  can switch different things for each  camera to do like for example video  recording notification or the different  alarms you want each one to do and you  can also go back in for example turn on  Geo fencing which will use your GPS  location to see when you left your house  to switch to a different mode which is  definitely cool now we also have the  explore tab which here UV security shows  off a lot of their other products  including some of their discounts as as  you can see you can order additional  things like an add-on camera if you want  three instead of two you can even order  their floodlight their video doorbell  Smart Lock alarm system and a lot of  these products will work together but  getting back to the devices tab as you  can see I have my two cameras and my  yuffie home base but I'm gonna go into  the bionic mind AI face management which  basically uses smart AI to detect new  faces which you can review and approve  adding them to the system of course  you've also got the AI empowerment which  uses the automatic smart AI to detect  things like the cars and animals which  is in beta or of course humans now over  here we have the storage management page  which you see the local storage about 16  gigs and the one terabyte hard drive  which I added in manually but the home  base will accept either a hard drive or  SSD up to 16 terabytes which is a ton of  storage but let's go back to our camera  view you and let's go over to the shop  now check out how fast this is boom that  is the live preview that is literally  audio playing oh it looks like a trade  trade is going by so I'm just gonna mute  the audio with that button right there  now as you can see there's a hold and  speak button so you could literally just  hold it and say a message to whoever's  out there hey what's up you have the  little record button right here so it'll  literally record a clip let's say you  see somebody on the camera you want to  record it tap record there you go it's  going then as soon as you hit stop it  actually goes to your camera roll right  there  there you go on top of that you have  this little scissor button which just  literally takes a screenshot puts it  into your camera roll as well and we  have some more options over here where  we could actually turn on an alarm  okay so that's going outside that's  probably really loud  I'm just gonna hit the stop button  that's probably really loud out there so  I'm going to turn it off and then you  have this button right here which turns  on the spotlight obviously right now we  won't see anything out there because  it's very bright but I tested it out  works great you also have the night  vision which you can switch between the  Black and White Night Vision or the  spotlight and then we have the little  gear icon with a bunch of different  settings you can see the solar charging  if it's working well you see the Wi-Fi  connection you see the battery you can  actually go into the motion detection  and change the sensitivity I've adjusted  this zone so if anything walks into here  it's going to give me a notification on  top of that we have the power manager  you can optimize for battery life you  can optimize for surveillance you can  even go into the solar dashboard and see  how the solar charging is working as you  can see over the past few days it's  charged up to 100 using solar alone and  then going back we have the spotlight  settings which you can set it to very  high brightness and then we have the  anti-theft detection and the Privacy  zones which literally you can see I set  up a privacy zone right there now  finally getting into the quality I'm  going to switch over to my backyard Cam  and show you guys how great the 4K  quality really is hinge to zoom  and you can zoom in live into your feed  anywhere you want and like guys this  quality is crazy crazy good I checked it  out and I looked at myself especially at  night and I was blown away by the level  of detail you can see on my face with  and without the spotlight on even the  night vision and then of course you can  just hit this button and go into full  screen mode if you really want to take a  closer look and take advantage of your  entire display but I've got to say that  the combination of Incredible video  quality and especially the Flawless  software within the app just blew my  mind everything just works you don't get  weird 